  "note": "lat_deg/lon_deg_east are null on purpose: NASA does not publish region centres (2022 release: regions about 15x15 km, landing site about 100 m radius, within 6 deg of the pole; 2024 release: no sizes, no coordinates). derived_box_centre_* are the centre of the PUBLISHED GeoTIFF extent (header ModelTiepoint, 5 m pixel scale, raster size) converted with spherical R=1737.4 km polar stereographic, x=rho sin(lon), y=rho cos(lon) (convention of backend/domain/grazing/dem.lock.json). They locate the DEM tile, NOT the landing region, and must not be used as site coordinates.",
  "dem_frame": "south polar stereographic X/Y metres, MOON_ME frame of DE421, pixel-registered (README of pgda LOLA_5mpp)",
